// Copy this file to Local.xcconfig (same directory) and fill in your own Apple
// Developer Team ID. Local.xcconfig is gitignored — it is never committed, so a
// public clone of this repo carries no one's specific Team ID baked in.
//
// Find your Team ID at https://developer.apple.com/account (Membership details),
// or in Xcode ▸ Settings ▸ Accounts ▸ your Apple ID ▸ your team.
//
// project.yml (`xcodegen generate`) reads this as the base config for every
// target, so this one setting is all a fresh clone needs to build and sign
// locally with automatic signing.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID_HERE
